	<element name="Paladin" type="Class" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_WOTC_PHB_CLASS_PALADIN">
		<description><p>Whether sworn before a god’s altar or in a glade before nature spirits, a paladin’s oath is a powerful bond, and a source of power that turns a devout warrior into a blessed champion.</p><p>Hit Dice: 1d10 per paladin level. Proficiencies: all armor, shields, simple and martial weapons. Saving throws: Wisdom, Charisma. Skills: choose two from Athletics, Insight, Intimidation, Medicine, Persuasion and Religion.</p></description>
