	<element name="Cleansing Touch" type="Class Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_CLASS_FEATURE_PALADIN_CLEANSING_TOUCH">
		<description><p>You can use your action to end one spell on yourself or on one willing creature that you touch. You can use this a number of times equal to your Charisma modifier (minimum once) per long rest.</p></description>
